From 6bacc0747f972b04854ae994ce4a924ac66fc75d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel Angel Ajo Pelayo <miguelangel@ajo.es>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:35:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] intronix-logicport: Initial driver implementation.

Support the Intronix LogicPort LA1034: it performs FPGA bit-bang
loading via the onboard FTDI chip. Depends on the vendor LogicPort.ccf
file that must be instaled as intronix-logicport.ccf.

Supports: 1kHz-500MHz, and up to 2048 samples with RLE compression,
          hardware triggers, voltage threshold configuration.
